From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yash Dayani <52958495+YashDayani@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:01:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: cache QS layout and slider settings

QSAnimator.setPosition, QSImpl.setQsExpansion and the QS brightness/volume
sliders read Settings.System through TileUtils and VerticalSlider on every
shade expansion frame. getIntForUser(..., USER_CURRENT) bypasses the client
NameValueCache, so each read was a synchronous binder call into
system_server: ~50 per shade pull, up to 58 inside a single frame, and the
main cause of 50-100 ms frames when pulling down the shade on kyoto.

Keep these values in a process-wide cache that is dropped on any
Settings.System change or user switch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
